WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.700
Pika! Pikachu!

2
00:00:04.166 --> 00:00:07.400
Come on, Pikachu, I can't see if you don't move.

3
00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:09.366
- Pika
- Come here, buddy.

4
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.200
- Pikachu.
- Hey, Mom, professor.

5
00:00:12.266 --> 00:00:13.333
Hi, Ash.

6
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.000
Have you been well?

7
00:00:15.066 --> 00:00:16.766
You bet. I feel great.

8
00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:19.566
Hi, Serena. Hi, Bonnie.

9
00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:20.800
Clemont, too.

10
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.166
How have you been?

11
00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.333
- Great.
- We're doing quite well, thank you.

12
00:00:25.566 --> 00:00:27.466
I've been having so much fun.

13
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:30.566
Mom, there's so many things I have to tell you about.

14
00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:35.566
- I'll be flying back later this afternoon.
- Good. We can hardly wait.

15
00:00:35.633 --> 00:00:37.733
Just promise me you'll be careful.

16
00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:41.866
And the rest of you, come visit Pallet Town soon.

17
00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:45.566
- I'll make you a tasty meal.
- Thank you.

18
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.766
Okay, let's get packed.

19
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.466
- Can't forget anything.
- Pikachu.

20
00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:33.333
Let's eat.

21
00:01:36.466 --> 00:01:38.100
Wow, delicious.

22
00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.900
There's still plenty left.

23
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:43.433
Huh?

24
00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:48.433
- Is there something wrong?
- Mm-mm.

25
00:01:48.866 --> 00:01:53.166
- You're not feeling sick, are you?
- I might have eaten too many snacks.

26
00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:56.866
I warned you you shouldn't snack right before a meal.

27
00:01:56.933 --> 00:01:58.666
Uh... yeah.

28
00:01:59.766 --> 00:02:00.733
Dedenne.

29
00:02:02.233 --> 00:02:03.066
Huh?

30
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:08.533
- Alain.
- Professor Sycamore.

31
00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.166
- Mairin.
- Hey, there.

32
00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.633
Hello, everyone.

33
00:02:12.066 --> 00:02:15.000
- So, what are you doing here?
- Thought I'd say hi

34
00:02:15.066 --> 00:02:16.800
before we go our separate ways.

35
00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:22.633
Team Flare was controlling the Pokémon Zygarde

36
00:02:22.766 --> 00:02:25.300
who unleashed a massive attack on Kalos.

37
00:02:25.366 --> 00:02:28.466
But the only thing that can defeat evil is evil.

38
00:02:28.533 --> 00:02:31.733
So, Team Rocket wiped out Team Flare

39
00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.600
and took out Zygarde while we were at it.

40
00:02:37.666 --> 00:02:39.333
And that's the way it is.

41
00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.900
Our anti-Team Flare victory report--

42
00:02:41.966 --> 00:02:43.700
Is now history.

43
00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.866
So, what do you think, sir?

44
00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:48.366
Were we a success?

45
00:02:48.433 --> 00:02:50.933
Now Team Rocket can take over the whole world.

46
00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.766
Wobbuffet!

47
00:02:53.766 --> 00:02:54.766
Interesting.

48
00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.166
The situation is quite clear.

49
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:02.466
Fact is you were behind the complete annihilation of Team Flare.

50
00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:05.466
Well done, Jesse, James and Meowth.

51
00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:06.766
Return to base.

52
00:03:07.066 --> 00:03:07.900
Roger.

53
00:03:08.233 --> 00:03:10.400
We'll head to Kanto straight away.

54
00:03:10.833 --> 00:03:11.966
I'll be here.

55
00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:20.766
Our video really rang the boss's chimes.

56
00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:23.133
It was worth every recording moment.

57
00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:25.933
These paws of mine are editing gold.

58
00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:27.400
Wobbuffet!

59
00:03:27.466 --> 00:03:30.533
Headquarters, ho. It's off to the boss, we go.

60
00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:33.133
This is no time to be slow.

61
00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.800
- Alain, too?
- That's right.

62
00:03:36.166 --> 00:03:38.033
There's nothing as taxing as a journey,

63
00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.000
but I'll be helping the professor. With Mairin.

64
00:03:41.066 --> 00:03:43.366
First off, we're heading for Frost Cavern.

65
00:03:43.433 --> 00:03:44.566
Ches!

66
00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:48.000
This is the path I've decided to take.

67
00:03:48.066 --> 00:03:49.066
Right.

68
00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:53.766
We've learned this. When the sundial is bathed in the light of the setting sun,

69
00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.333
it gives off energy.

70
00:03:55.566 --> 00:03:57.333
When we traced that energy,

71
00:03:57.400 --> 00:04:00.333
we discovered a material similar to Mega Stones.

72
00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.466
Wow. Does that mean the material is in the Frost Cavern?

73
00:04:04.533 --> 00:04:07.833
Yeah, and we found the same thing in other places, too.

74
00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:10.700
That's why we're on our way there. Research.

75
00:04:11.133 --> 00:04:13.600
Alain, what happened to your Mega Ring?

76
00:04:14.033 --> 00:04:17.066
Oh, I borrowed that Mega Ring from Lysandre.

77
00:04:17.399 --> 00:04:20.600
I gave it over to the authorities to use as evidence.

78
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:23.266
But... what about Mega-Evolving?

79
00:04:23.933 --> 00:04:26.966
It'll be fine. I'll just start from square one.

80
00:04:27.366 --> 00:04:32.766
I'll find my own Mega Stone and Key Stone from the ground up. Just like you, Ash.

81
00:04:33.633 --> 00:04:35.766
Yeah. Let's do our best.

82
00:04:42.533 --> 00:04:45.966
When the time comes... we should have another battle.

83
00:04:46.933 --> 00:04:48.566
Will you? What do you say?

84
00:04:50.833 --> 00:04:51.666
Yeah.

85
00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:57.100
I'll see you around.

86
00:05:06.333 --> 00:05:08.266
- Chespin.
- Chespin.

87
00:05:08.333 --> 00:05:11.433
Ches...

88
00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:14.933
Serena... thanks for everything.

89
00:05:15.366 --> 00:05:18.933
Remember the time you let me know you'd come along with me?

90
00:05:19.166 --> 00:05:20.433
That was so nice.

91
00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.200
Mm-mm. I wasn't being nice.

92
00:05:23.266 --> 00:05:24.433
A deal is a deal.

93
00:05:24.866 --> 00:05:27.566
Okay. I'm glad we'll always be friends.

94
00:05:27.633 --> 00:05:28.533
Me too.

95
00:05:30.833 --> 00:05:34.633
So, Alain, Mairin... we'll see you later.

96
00:05:35.066 --> 00:05:37.600
- Bye-bye, you guys.
- Chespin.

97
00:05:37.666 --> 00:05:39.666
You all have a marvelous time.

98
00:05:39.733 --> 00:05:41.833
- And you, too.
- Pika.

99
00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.866
- Take care, everyone.
- See you.

100
00:05:43.933 --> 00:05:45.066
Be careful.

101
00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.333
Well, they're gone.

102
00:05:52.666 --> 00:05:54.733
Okay, we should get ready.

103
00:05:55.133 --> 00:05:56.133
Pika.

104
00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.233
You're right.

105
00:06:02.566 --> 00:06:03.600
Denne?

106
00:06:12.633 --> 00:06:14.133
Final boarding call.

107
00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:19.333
Dragonite Airlines flight K91 to Kanto is now boarding at Gate 12.

108
00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.933
Looks like your flight is the next one.

109
00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:25.533
Latias Airlines flight H71

110
00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:28.966
- to the Hoenn region will begin boarding.
- That's it.

111
00:06:29.033 --> 00:06:32.766
- Let's go see Serena off first.
- Let's get your boarding pass.

112
00:06:36.333 --> 00:06:37.366
Denne?

113
00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:42.366
- Step on it, people!
- Gate number 12. Number 12.

114
00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:47.200
- You spent too much time buying presents.
- Speak for yourself, moneybags.

115
00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:51.833
Gifts for the boss are investments in us.

116
00:06:53.966 --> 00:06:54.800
Everyone?

117
00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:56.800
It's time to say goodbye.

118
00:06:56.866 --> 00:06:59.000
We won't be seeing you for a while.

119
00:07:03.166 --> 00:07:04.133
Pancham.

120
00:07:09.466 --> 00:07:10.933
Chespin!

121
00:07:11.566 --> 00:07:12.866
Sylveon.

122
00:07:12.933 --> 00:07:14.200
Bunnelby.

123
00:07:14.266 --> 00:07:16.933
- Sylveon.
- Bunnelby.

124
00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:20.266
- Hawlucha.
- Braixen.

125
00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:22.700
- Pikachu.
- Hawlucha.

126
00:07:23.133 --> 00:07:24.866
- Pancham.
- Luxray.

127
00:07:38.933 --> 00:07:40.066
Braixen.

128
00:07:40.966 --> 00:07:42.066
Dedenne.

129
00:07:46.566 --> 00:07:47.400
Dedenne?

130
00:07:47.466 --> 00:07:50.200
Dedenne, you've gotta say bye-bye.

131
00:07:50.266 --> 00:07:51.900
Dedenne.

132
00:07:52.333 --> 00:07:55.466
- Just for a little while.
- We'll see each other again.

133
00:07:56.833 --> 00:07:57.733
Pika, Pikachu.

134
00:07:58.333 --> 00:07:59.533
Dedenne.

135
00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.000
Oh, Dedenne.

136
00:08:12.733 --> 00:08:13.566
Whoa!

137
00:08:13.633 --> 00:08:14.833
Dedenne.

138
00:08:18.533 --> 00:08:20.966
Who's that Pokémon?

139
00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.133
It's Pikachu.

140
00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.166
Dedenne.

141
00:08:39.533 --> 00:08:40.533
Dedenne?

142
00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:44.366
Hey, where are you? Pikachu, why don't you help us out?

143
00:08:44.966 --> 00:08:46.800
Pika, pika, pika.

144
00:08:48.333 --> 00:08:49.800
- Pika.
- All right.

145
00:08:52.233 --> 00:08:54.233
- Pika.
- Dedenne.

146
00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.200
Dedenne.

147
00:08:59.266 --> 00:09:01.933
Latias Airlines Flight H71...

148
00:09:02.366 --> 00:09:04.933
- Dedenne.
- Where are you?

149
00:09:08.366 --> 00:09:11.066
- Pikachu.
- Find Dedenne, Pikachu.

150
00:09:14.233 --> 00:09:15.866
- Dedenne.
- Dedenne.

151
00:09:16.466 --> 00:09:17.633
Pikachu.

152
00:09:17.933 --> 00:09:18.866
Dedenne.

153
00:09:20.133 --> 00:09:21.733
Dedenne, come out.

154
00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:23.033
I'm begging you.

155
00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:26.233
Arg.

156
00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.866
Dedenne.

157
00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:31.366
Dedenne, you've just got to come out here. Please.

158
00:09:31.733 --> 00:09:33.366
Dedenne.

159
00:09:34.366 --> 00:09:35.366
Dedenne.

160
00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:36.833
I know why.

161
00:09:37.133 --> 00:09:40.100
Dedenne doesn't want to say goodbye to everyone.

162
00:09:41.233 --> 00:09:42.233
Pika.

163
00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:48.300
What do I do?

164
00:09:48.366 --> 00:09:49.966
I need you, Dedenne.

165
00:09:50.033 --> 00:09:52.266
I understand what you're feeling.

166
00:09:52.333 --> 00:09:55.100
I just know you wanna stay together forever

167
00:09:55.533 --> 00:09:58.133
because we've all had so much fun together.

168
00:09:59.033 --> 00:10:00.466
Well, so do I.

169
00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:04.400
I love everyone, too. But we all have dreams of our own.

170
00:10:04.833 --> 00:10:10.100
Serena, Ash and everyone wants to try to make their dreams come true.

171
00:10:11.333 --> 00:10:15.133
Sure I'm really sad, but I've gotta be strong.

172
00:10:15.766 --> 00:10:19.133
When I get old enough, I'll be a Pokémon trainer.

173
00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.566
And I'll want you to be my partner.

174
00:10:21.966 --> 00:10:25.200
I'll become a performer who's just as good as Serena.

175
00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:28.066
I'll earn a gym badge from my brother.

176
00:10:28.133 --> 00:10:33.466
We'll beat Ash and Pikachu and then we'll become number one in Kalos.

177
00:10:35.066 --> 00:10:37.566
And so, let's dream, too.

178
00:10:37.633 --> 00:10:41.233
We can say our goodbyes and still laugh together.

179
00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:42.300
What do you say?

180
00:10:44.666 --> 00:10:46.000
Dedenne.

181
00:10:52.700 --> 00:10:53.966
It's okay.

182
00:10:57.666 --> 00:11:01.266
Dedenne, you can help Bonnie make her dreams come true.

183
00:11:01.633 --> 00:11:02.733
Pika, pika.

184
00:11:04.066 --> 00:11:06.033
You'll see. We'll battle.

185
00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:10.833
I know I'm gonna have to do my best. Or you'll beat me.

186
00:11:11.966 --> 00:11:14.000
None of us wanna lose to you.

187
00:11:16.266 --> 00:11:17.366
You hear that?

188
00:11:18.066 --> 00:11:19.266
Denne.

189
00:11:22.566 --> 00:11:26.833
Latias Airlines flight H71 will finish boarding soon.

190
00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:31.733
Ticket holders who have not yet boarded, please proceed to the gate immediately.

191
00:11:32.033 --> 00:11:33.500
Okay, it's time to go.

192
00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:39.000
Ash, Clemont, Bonnie... you've all given me so very much.

193
00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:41.066
More than I can say.

194
00:11:41.566 --> 00:11:44.566
- Pika, pika.
- Give us a call once in a while.

195
00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:48.266
You can be sure that we're all gonna come and visit you.

196
00:11:48.966 --> 00:11:50.833
Mm-hm.

197
00:11:51.866 --> 00:11:55.433
Ash, thank you. I'm glad I came with you.

198
00:11:56.633 --> 00:11:58.400
You're the kind of person I wanna be.

199
00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:07.466
Next time we meet, you're gonna like the kind of person I've grown into.

200
00:12:08.733 --> 00:12:09.566
Awesome.

201
00:12:10.966 --> 00:12:11.833
See you.

202
00:12:22.333 --> 00:12:24.900
Hey, Ash, there's just one more thing.

203
00:12:42.500 --> 00:12:43.633
Thank you.

204
00:12:47.766 --> 00:12:50.433
- Bye, Serena.
- Take care of yourself, Serena.

205
00:12:50.933 --> 00:12:52.166
Bye-bye.

206
00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.300
Bye-bye.

207
00:13:00.766 --> 00:13:02.933
Pika, pika!

208
00:13:04.066 --> 00:13:05.533
Well, there she goes.

209
00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:09.500
Serena's gotten really strong, so, she'll be fine.

210
00:13:09.566 --> 00:13:13.300
- And she'll get a lot stronger in Hoenn.
- She sure will.

211
00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.266
And I'll work hard to be an inventor.

212
00:13:16.433 --> 00:13:18.666
An inventor who makes Pokémon happy.

213
00:13:18.866 --> 00:13:19.700
Yeah.

214
00:13:20.466 --> 00:13:23.100
You still have some time before your flight.

215
00:13:23.166 --> 00:13:25.133
Yeah. What should we do?

216
00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:29.633
There's something I'd like to ask of you. A small favor.

217
00:13:30.066 --> 00:13:32.400
It's something that I really wanna do.

218
00:13:43.533 --> 00:13:44.633
If you don't mind,

219
00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:47.633
I wanna have one final battle between you and me.

220
00:13:47.866 --> 00:13:50.066
Yeah. You've got it, Clemont.

221
00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.000
Now, Pikachu, let's go!

222
00:13:52.066 --> 00:13:53.200
Pikachu.

223
00:13:53.633 --> 00:13:55.700
All right, Bunnelby, you too.

224
00:13:59.566 --> 00:14:02.533
Okay, then, battle begin!

225
00:14:07.066 --> 00:14:08.933
Pikachu, Thunderbolt, let's go!

226
00:14:11.133 --> 00:14:12.800
Dodge and use Mud Shot.

227
00:14:16.400 --> 00:14:17.800
Use Iron Tail.

228
00:14:20.466 --> 00:14:22.100
Quick Attack, now!

229
00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.933
Use Wild Charge.

230
00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.433
Now Double Slap.

231
00:14:32.866 --> 00:14:34.000
Iron Tail, go.

232
00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.433
I'm Serena.

233
00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:10.733
Will you help me make my dream come true?

234
00:15:10.966 --> 00:15:11.900
Finish.

235
00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:17.033
Serena's gotten really strong, she'll be fine.

236
00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:20.766
Wow, I'd really like to become great friends with that Eevee.

237
00:15:22.766 --> 00:15:25.600
I did everything I possibly could.

238
00:15:25.666 --> 00:15:27.266
Finished. Yeah.

239
00:15:36.433 --> 00:15:39.166
The future is now. Thanks to science.

240
00:15:39.566 --> 00:15:42.200
- Clemontic Gear on.
- So amazing!

241
00:15:42.266 --> 00:15:44.966
You came back after all. Luxio.

242
00:15:45.033 --> 00:15:47.533
I want this battle to go on and on.

243
00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.666
Show me the real Ash all the way to the final move.

244
00:15:52.933 --> 00:15:53.866
Oh, Clembot.

245
00:15:55.333 --> 00:15:57.266
I'm so happy I know you.

246
00:16:01.233 --> 00:16:02.300
A Pikachu.

247
00:16:02.366 --> 00:16:04.133
And what a cutie.

248
00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.066
Pika, pika.

249
00:16:07.166 --> 00:16:08.633
It's so cute.

250
00:16:09.033 --> 00:16:10.366
It's like a flower.

251
00:16:10.966 --> 00:16:12.400
Take good care.

252
00:16:12.466 --> 00:16:16.033
You're all clean now. I'm gonna take care of it.

253
00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:17.133
My brother.

254
00:16:17.566 --> 00:16:18.533
You heard me.

255
00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:20.100
You heard my voice.

256
00:16:20.166 --> 00:16:22.800
We'll be together again. That's a promise.

257
00:17:47.966 --> 00:17:51.033
Ash from Pallet Town is finally here.

258
00:17:53.733 --> 00:17:55.633
All right, Pikachu, let's go.

259
00:17:56.066 --> 00:17:59.233
- Yes, this is it, the Lumiose Gym.
- Pika.

260
00:18:05.566 --> 00:18:06.500
Huh?

261
00:18:10.133 --> 00:18:12.700
Right, Fletchling, Steel Wing, let's go!

262
00:18:13.433 --> 00:18:16.733
I want the battle to be against you instead of Clembot.

263
00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.400
That sounds good to me.

264
00:18:19.833 --> 00:18:21.566
Great. That's what we'll do.

265
00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:27.066
Maybe this is a haunted mansion that grabs people and then eats them.

266
00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.166
Did I say that?

267
00:18:28.233 --> 00:18:29.766
Okay, my turn. Who?

268
00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.466
Right, Pikachu?

269
00:18:43.366 --> 00:18:45.400
Whoa!

270
00:18:45.833 --> 00:18:47.500
That's nice of you, Serena.

271
00:18:49.800 --> 00:18:50.633
Goomy.

272
00:18:51.066 --> 00:18:52.000
That feel good?

273
00:18:52.066 --> 00:18:53.633
Goomy.

274
00:18:53.700 --> 00:18:54.566
Take this.

275
00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:56.900
- Wanted you to have something from me.
- Thank you.

276
00:18:56.966 --> 00:18:58.433
Shh. Shh.

277
00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.133
- Let's continue together.
- Deal.

278
00:19:04.566 --> 00:19:05.966
Great to have you back.

279
00:19:06.566 --> 00:19:10.833
Bonnie, Serena, Clemont, here we go.

280
00:19:35.033 --> 00:19:37.566
Is everyone ready to make their wish now?

281
00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:41.633
Hi, my name's Ash.

282
00:19:42.100 --> 00:19:43.166
I'm Alain.

283
00:19:48.833 --> 00:19:49.833
Oh, no!

284
00:19:50.366 --> 00:19:53.666
- You're not acting like the Ash I know.
- Unh!

285
00:20:10.566 --> 00:20:14.833
Get ready for this, Sawyer. This is everything Greninja and I have got.

286
00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:16.100
Water Shuriken.

287
00:20:22.966 --> 00:20:26.400
- Charizard, use Dragon Claw.
- Ready for more?

288
00:21:30.366 --> 00:21:33.100
- Pika!
- We're finally in Pallet Town.

289
00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:34.233
Pikachu.

290
00:21:52.966 --> 00:21:54.066
I'm home.

291
00:21:54.233 --> 00:21:55.766
Pika, pika!
